WEBVTT

00:01.270 --> 00:02.730
<b>Akane, can you hear me?</b>

00:05.060 --> 00:06.440
<b>I'm going to pick you up, okay?</b>

01:51.130 --> 01:51.960
<b>Is he picking up?</b>

01:53.460 --> 01:57.220
<b>Episode 10:
I'll Definitely Be Hurt Someday</b>

01:54.510 --> 01:55.340
<b>No.</b>

01:58.180 --> 02:00.550
<b>His tutoring session
might be going overtime.</b>

02:01.390 --> 02:05.220
<b>Even still,
it's not like him not to let us know.</b>

02:05.220 --> 02:07.180
<b>Who knows? Maybe he's out with a girl.</b>

02:07.690 --> 02:10.600
<b>I mean, how suspicious
was that call he got the other day?</b>

02:12.060 --> 02:13.940
<b>Yamada's not that kind of character.</b>

02:14.440 --> 02:16.360
<b>You don't get him, Prez.</b>

02:17.110 --> 02:21.870
<b>You need to stay on your toes,
or you'll lose him to some random girl.</b>

02:27.580 --> 02:28.710
<b>I know that.</b>

02:31.630 --> 02:32.750
<b>I know...</b>

02:33.130 --> 02:34.460
<b>so don't pressure me like that.</b>

02:38.050 --> 02:42.390
<b>If it's tearing you up inside like that,
you might as well tell him.</b>

02:43.100 --> 02:45.310
<b>What's holding you back?</b>

02:48.060 --> 02:50.230
<b><i>One of these days, he'll meet someone.</i></b>

02:51.600 --> 02:52.940
<b><i>I have a feeling that he will.</i></b>

02:57.780 --> 03:00.240
<b>Yamada, do you know GOS:E?</b>

03:00.240 --> 03:03.450
<b>It's an FPS game. You play it, right?</b>

03:03.660 --> 03:07.410
<b>Last night at around 22:00, you played me.
Do you remember?</b>

03:10.120 --> 03:11.830
<b>I'm Tsubaki Yukari from Class D.</b>

03:12.290 --> 03:15.540
<b>I battled you under the name YT03.</b>

03:15.710 --> 03:17.840
<b>I GOT YOUR SNS
FROM YOUR ACCOUNT</b>

03:16.250 --> 03:20.170
<b>And if you don't mind,
I'd like you to show me how you play.</b>

03:17.840 --> 03:21.340
<b>I DON'T REMEMBER THAT
AT ALL...</b>

03:22.010 --> 03:22.840
<b>Why?</b>

03:23.300 --> 03:25.260
<b>I just have my reasons, that's why.</b>

03:26.430 --> 03:28.430
<b>She thinks you cheated!</b>

03:34.190 --> 03:35.830
<b>Once you've taken a look,
please leave, okay?</b>

03:35.830 --> 03:36.700
<b>Of course.</b>

03:36.700 --> 03:39.900
<b>Tsubaki, watch my epic gameplay
later, too!</b>

04:03.930 --> 04:06.430
<b>The truth is, I was a little suspicious.</b>

04:06.970 --> 04:09.720
<b>I didn't think anyone
could play like that, not on skill alone.</b>

04:14.310 --> 04:17.860
<b>I'm sorry. That was ignorant of me.</b>

04:18.360 --> 04:20.070
<b>So there are people with amazing skills.</b>

04:21.240 --> 04:22.990
<b>Shouldn't you be playing professionally?</b>

04:31.290 --> 04:33.660
<b><i>Just like I met you...</i></b>

04:38.840 --> 04:39.920
<b><i>I know that one day...</i></b>

04:43.010 --> 04:44.180
<b><i>you'll meet somebody, too.</i></b>

05:01.030 --> 05:05.490
<b><i>For someone with such arresting
good looks, he's quiet and reserved.</i></b>

05:06.530 --> 05:10.530
<b><i>For someone who speaks so bluntly,
he's actually pretty thoughtful.</i></b>

05:11.540 --> 05:14.710
<b><i>Anyone who's good friends with him
knows that.</i></b>

05:15.960 --> 05:16.920
<b><i>As well as...</i></b>

05:17.830 --> 05:22.210
<b>Yamada, when we worked together
on the committee last week,</b>

05:22.210 --> 05:26.180
<b>you really helped me out a lot, so...</b>

05:26.550 --> 05:28.680
<b>Huh? Have you and I ever spoken?</b>

05:29.720 --> 05:32.140
<b><i>...the fact that you
can also be a little cruel.</i></b>

05:33.180 --> 05:34.730
<b>Hey, did you hear?</b>

05:34.730 --> 05:38.310
<b>Ms. Shiraishi of Class D
finally confessed her feelings to Yamada!</b>

05:38.310 --> 05:39.270
<b>Seriously?</b>

05:39.270 --> 05:41.070
<b>But of course she got shot down.</b>

05:41.070 --> 05:44.570
<b>No way. If Ms. Shiraishi
can't get him, then who can?</b>

05:44.570 --> 05:45.990
<b>Maybe he's not into girls?</b>

05:45.990 --> 05:46.820
<b>For real?</b>

05:46.820 --> 05:49.570
<b>THEY'RE GOSSIPING ABOUT HIM
LIKE IT'S A FREE-FOR-ALL...</b>

05:46.820 --> 05:51.410
<b>MATH II
CORE EDITION</b>

05:47.150 --> 05:48.990
<b>Come on! That would be such a waste!</b>

05:49.820 --> 05:51.660
<b>I FEEL A LITTLE SORRY
FOR HIM.</b>

05:51.490 --> 05:54.200
<b>CLASS JOURNAL
SECOND SEMESTER</b>

05:54.200 --> 05:56.750
<b>We're second years,
and you still don't have a girlfriend.</b>

05:54.580 --> 05:58.580
<b>DAY DUTY</b>

05:57.870 --> 05:59.830
<b>When someone as popular as you
stays single,</b>

05:59.920 --> 06:01.500
<b>it'll set off all these false rumors.</b>

06:02.840 --> 06:06.840
<b>WEARY</b>

06:04.000 --> 06:06.130
<b>Why should that matter to me,</b>

06:06.130 --> 06:07.260
<b>what people say?</b>

06:07.760 --> 06:10.850
<b>Well, I hear you, but people
are saying all kinds of things about you,</b>

06:10.850 --> 06:12.100
<b>and I feel bad.</b>

06:12.100 --> 06:16.100
<b>MR. OKAMOTO DITCHED CLEANING AGAIN
HE NEEDS TO BE PENALIZED SOMEHOW...</b>

06:13.180 --> 06:14.350
<b>Don't you have a type?</b>

06:15.140 --> 06:16.100
<b>Not really.</b>

06:16.520 --> 06:18.640
<b>You must have some idea.
Even you...</b>

06:18.640 --> 06:19.560
<b>I don't.</b>

06:20.270 --> 06:22.060
<b>Then what about your first crush?</b>

06:22.060 --> 06:23.150
<b>I mean, it...</b>

06:26.070 --> 06:26.940
<b>I don't have one.</b>

06:28.030 --> 06:29.110
<b><i>He sighed.</i></b>

06:31.620 --> 06:33.620
<b>- Sorry.
- No, no, I'm sorry.</b>

06:33.620 --> 06:35.200
<b>I shouldn't have pestered you.</b>

06:36.950 --> 06:39.710
<b>ASHAMED...</b>

06:38.500 --> 06:39.540
<b><i>Remorse.</i></b>

06:40.210 --> 06:41.210
<b>Um...</b>

06:42.210 --> 06:45.460
<b>Um... um...</b>

06:46.210 --> 06:47.630
<b>Come to think of it...</b>

06:46.210 --> 06:47.970
<b>GLOOM</b>

06:48.920 --> 06:52.550
<b>years ago,
there was a girl who liked me.</b>

06:53.350 --> 06:56.100
<b>And everyone bullied her like crazy...</b>

06:56.390 --> 06:57.220
<b>What?</b>

06:56.470 --> 06:57.220
<b>BULLIED?</b>

06:57.390 --> 07:00.060
<b>...so she stopped coming to school.</b>

07:05.320 --> 07:09.280
<b>But since I lived nearby, our teacher
would send me to her house with handouts.</b>

07:09.820 --> 07:11.450
<b>And that's how we got to be friends.</b>

07:12.570 --> 07:15.660
<b>But when she did show up at school,</b>

07:15.660 --> 07:17.790
<b>without me there,
it was like she didn't belong.</b>

07:19.620 --> 07:22.330
<b>So I tried to stay by her side
as much as I could.</b>

07:24.590 --> 07:28.420
<b>Then you liked that girl, too, Yamada.</b>

07:31.300 --> 07:32.640
<b><i>Akito...</i></b>

07:33.510 --> 07:36.760
<b><i>let's always be together,
even after we're grown up.</i></b>

07:37.390 --> 07:39.640
<b><i>I can't promise you that.</i></b>

07:41.730 --> 07:45.270
<b>I only did all that
because our teacher told me to.</b>

07:45.270 --> 07:46.770
<b>That's all there was to it.</b>

07:52.070 --> 07:55.030
<b>The bullying never stopped,
so she ended up transferring out.</b>

07:57.660 --> 08:00.620
<b>But sometimes I remember her.</b>

08:04.380 --> 08:08.090
<b>I made her cry really hard
the last time we spoke.</b>

08:09.380 --> 08:13.680
<b>And sometimes I wonder what
would have been the right thing to say.</b>

08:17.010 --> 08:18.510
<b>But I never found the answer.</b>

08:20.430 --> 08:23.810
<b>And it all started to seem
like such a pain.</b>

08:26.060 --> 08:29.940
<b>So ever since then,
I've never been comfortable around girls.</b>

08:35.070 --> 08:36.490
<b><i>I see.</i></b>

08:36.490 --> 08:40.080
<b><i>So this guy doesn't have
much interest in himself.</i></b>

08:41.750 --> 08:45.790
<b><i>That's why he doesn't really see
the people who care about him.</i></b>

08:46.880 --> 08:50.250
<b><i>Or else he's deliberately
averting his gaze from them.</i></b>

08:52.550 --> 08:56.470
<b><i>Did he say it was a pain? Scary!</i></b>

08:56.470 --> 08:59.180
<b><i>I'd better make sure
I don't fall for this guy.</i></b>

08:57.970 --> 09:01.060
<b>DAY DUTY
AKITO YAMADA
YUKARI TSUBAKI</b>

09:00.810 --> 09:03.890
<b><i>If I ever fall in love
with someone this cruel...</i></b>

09:04.810 --> 09:06.400
<b><i>I'll definitely be hurt someday.</i></b>

09:07.350 --> 09:08.440
<b><i>I don't want that.</i></b>

09:09.610 --> 09:12.610
<b>COLD COMPRESS</b>

09:12.610 --> 09:15.610
<b>HEAVING HEAVING</b>

09:15.150 --> 09:16.860
<b>Delivery. Delivery...</b>

09:16.860 --> 09:17.700
<b>Akane?</b>

09:18.030 --> 09:19.160
<b>Can you drink some water?</b>

09:21.160 --> 09:22.450
<b>I can't. I can't...</b>

09:22.910 --> 09:25.330
<b>Have a little, even if you can't.</b>

09:27.960 --> 09:30.090
<b>GAG</b>

09:28.630 --> 09:30.090
<b>OKAY, SO SHE CAN'T...</b>

09:37.340 --> 09:38.970
<b><i>Her face is burning up.</i></b>

09:40.470 --> 09:42.970
<b><i>This fever of hers,
it's really bad, isn't it?</i></b>

09:44.890 --> 09:47.850
<b>C-Cold.</b>

09:58.700 --> 10:00.160
<b><i>I feel awful.</i></b>

10:00.530 --> 10:03.160
<b><i>I'm so hot. I'm cold.</i></b>

10:07.120 --> 10:08.500
<b><i>What's going on?</i></b>

10:09.170 --> 10:12.380
<b><i>Behind my eyes, my head is spinning.</i></b>

10:15.210 --> 10:20.550
<b><i>What's happening to me right now?</i></b>

10:22.390 --> 10:24.600
<b>Akane? Akane?</b>

10:25.520 --> 10:26.390
<b>Akane?</b>

10:29.350 --> 10:31.480
<b>Where's your health insurance card?</b>

10:32.270 --> 10:34.480
<b>Health in...</b>

10:34.980 --> 10:36.190
<b>Health insurance card.</b>

10:36.190 --> 10:39.360
<b>In my...</b>

10:39.950 --> 10:41.530
<b>bag.</b>

10:43.700 --> 10:48.870
<b><i>Huh? I could have sworn Yamada
was here just now.</i></b>

10:53.000 --> 10:54.380
<b><i>Am I imagining things?</i></b>

10:54.920 --> 10:56.920
<b>EVENING OUTPATIENT CLINIC
6PM - 10PM
RECEPTION</b>

10:55.800 --> 10:58.800
<b>Ms. Kinoshita? Can you hear me?</b>

10:59.130 --> 11:00.840
<b>Yes.</b>

11:01.430 --> 11:03.930
<b>I'm going to hook you up
to an I.V. drip now.</b>

11:01.840 --> 11:03.800
<b><i>Still, I have to say...</i></b>

11:03.930 --> 11:05.430
<b>I'm going to roll up your sleeve.</b>

11:04.350 --> 11:06.470
<b><i>it sure is noisy in here.</i></b>

11:13.150 --> 11:17.530
<b><i>Huh? What time is it now?</i></b>

11:18.240 --> 11:21.910
<b><i>So I fell asleep after that?</i></b>

11:22.740 --> 11:26.410
<b><i>I never did make it to the store.</i></b>

11:27.490 --> 11:32.710
<b><i>But I think I feel a tiny bit better.</i></b>

11:45.390 --> 11:46.470
<b>Huh?</b>

11:52.060 --> 11:52.980
<b>Why?</b>

11:54.770 --> 11:55.940
<b>Why?</b>

11:57.110 --> 11:58.110
<b>Why?</b>

12:05.030 --> 12:06.120
<b>Cold!</b>

12:11.500 --> 12:16.380
<b>AIRING OUT
THE ROOM</b>

12:11.660 --> 12:13.120
<b>Why are you here?</b>

12:16.630 --> 12:17.750
<b>AHA</b>

12:16.710 --> 12:18.800
<b>Aha! I get it! It's a dream!</b>

12:18.800 --> 12:19.960
<b>I'm cold.</b>

12:20.710 --> 12:24.390
<b>Achoo! Achoo! Achoo!</b>

12:22.880 --> 12:24.390
<b>THAT'S SOME
HARD-CORE SNEEZING...</b>

12:27.010 --> 12:30.350
<b>So you can stand up now.
How are you feeling?</b>

12:31.270 --> 12:33.060
<b>Huh? Surprised?</b>

12:33.060 --> 12:34.770
<b>I don't mean it that way.</b>

12:34.940 --> 12:36.150
<b>Wait, so this isn't a dream?</b>

12:36.150 --> 12:38.320
<b>Why are you here?
If you catch this, it'll be bad!</b>

12:37.770 --> 12:43.030
<b>SPLITTING HEADACHE
AND DIZZINESS
DUE TO SUDDEN
OUTBURST</b>

12:37.770 --> 12:43.030
<b>POUND
POUND</b>

12:38.320 --> 12:39.690
<b>Ouch.</b>

12:39.690 --> 12:43.030
<b>I'll explain it all to you,
so you should go back to bed.</b>

12:43.530 --> 12:46.450
<b>You couldn't even drink any water,
so you were in really bad shape.</b>

12:48.990 --> 12:50.120
<b>Okay.</b>

12:55.080 --> 12:57.330
<b>So how are you feeling?</b>

12:58.920 --> 13:02.130
<b>Now that you mention it, when I woke up,</b>

13:02.130 --> 13:04.510
<b>I thought that I
was starting to feel a little better.</b>

13:03.510 --> 13:05.090
<b>I WONDER WHY...</b>

13:06.340 --> 13:07.760
<b>That's a good thing, then.</b>

13:08.260 --> 13:11.640
<b>When I stopped by to check on you,
you'd collapsed by the bike racks.</b>

13:11.640 --> 13:12.470
<b>Is that right?</b>

13:13.310 --> 13:18.560
<b><i>Come to think of it, I did think
I saw someone that looked like Yamada.</i></b>

13:13.810 --> 13:16.310
<b>So first I carried you here.</b>

13:19.060 --> 13:22.400
<b><i>That means that it really was
 Yamada who helped me.</i></b>

13:23.440 --> 13:25.320
<b>But you seemed really sick, so...</b>

13:26.110 --> 13:29.740
<b><i>Did he come to check on me
because he was worried?</i></b>

13:31.040 --> 13:35.830
<b><i>He could have caught my cold himself,
but he stayed with me anyway?</i></b>

13:34.250 --> 13:36.870
<b>COMPASSION...</b>

13:37.210 --> 13:39.380
<b><i>Why would he be so nice...</i></b>

13:37.880 --> 13:42.300
<b>I found a hospital that was open at night,
and took you there.</b>

13:40.630 --> 13:42.300
<b><i>to someone like me?</i></b>

13:46.050 --> 13:46.880
<b>Huh?</b>

13:48.340 --> 13:49.300
<b>I'm so happy!</b>

13:49.800 --> 13:51.510
<b>Thank you so much, Yamada!</b>

13:52.520 --> 13:54.640
<b>You don't know
how exhausted I was on my own!</b>

13:55.480 --> 13:57.350
<b>You saved my life!</b>

13:58.060 --> 14:01.400
<b>I don't know
how I'm ever going to repay you!</b>

14:01.400 --> 14:06.150
<b>HIGHLY EMOTIONAL DUE TO HER FEVER</b>

14:01.860 --> 14:02.730
<b>You're an angel!</b>

14:01.950 --> 14:06.150
<b>THANK YOU
FOR BEING BORN</b>

14:02.730 --> 14:04.190
<b>Uh, right.</b>

14:03.320 --> 14:06.150
<b>SCARY</b>

14:05.030 --> 14:07.030
<b>So, as I was saying...</b>

14:07.860 --> 14:11.660
<b>I said you were cold when you're so kind!
I'm sorry!</b>

14:12.160 --> 14:13.870
<b>Did you ever say that to me?</b>

14:13.450 --> 14:17.920
<b>IF YOU CATCH THIS,
I'LL TAKE CARE OF YOU</b>

14:13.870 --> 14:16.870
<b>But you were kind from the start!</b>

14:16.870 --> 14:18.750
<b>If you move around like that, you'll fall.</b>

14:18.750 --> 14:21.630
<b>Hey. Sorry, I stepped on it.</b>

14:21.630 --> 14:22.460
<b>Huh?</b>

14:23.130 --> 14:25.050
<b>That book...</b>

14:25.050 --> 14:29.800
<b>TO YOU, WHO HAS GONE
THROUGH A BREAKUP
YUKO HAMAURA</b>

14:26.420 --> 14:29.340
<b>I didn't have anything to do,
so I borrowed it and started reading.</b>

14:30.140 --> 14:31.930
<b>Isn't this a great book?</b>

14:31.930 --> 14:34.970
<b>It totally saved me, you know!</b>

14:35.470 --> 14:36.850
<b>I didn't really get it.</b>

14:36.680 --> 14:40.310
<b>IT PUT ME TO SLEEP</b>

14:37.350 --> 14:39.850
<b>Well, it's not something
you could relate to.</b>

14:39.850 --> 14:42.940
<b>I'm pretty sure
you're the type who does the dumping.</b>

14:42.940 --> 14:46.190
<b>MEDICINE FOR A BROKEN HEART
TO THE NEW YOU</b>

14:43.480 --> 14:44.780
<b>No, I wouldn't say that.</b>

14:44.780 --> 14:46.190
<b>Come on, come on!</b>

14:46.190 --> 14:47.950
<b>DUE TO HIGH FEVER</b>

14:46.440 --> 14:48.650
<b>You've been really keyed up and scary.</b>

14:50.200 --> 14:51.740
<b>Ow, ow, ow.</b>

14:50.700 --> 14:54.700
<b>HER HEAD HURTS BECAUSE
 SHE GOT CARRIED AWAY...</b>

14:52.240 --> 14:56.040
<b>Well, I'm sure it's tough
for the dumpers, too, in their own way.</b>

14:56.540 --> 14:59.960
<b>But you're especially kind,
so it must be draining for you.</b>

15:05.500 --> 15:06.510
<b>I...</b>

15:07.920 --> 15:12.050
<b>I'm not the good guy you think I am.</b>

15:15.760 --> 15:17.730
<b>That's the same look Takuma gave me.</b>

15:18.930 --> 15:24.350
<b>Like he was sorry and exhausted
and he wished he could just disappear.</b>

15:24.530 --> 15:26.060
<b>It's all right. I don't mind.</b>

15:26.060 --> 15:27.320
<b>That's what romance is about.</b>

15:27.320 --> 15:28.360
<b>That's just how it is.</b>

15:29.950 --> 15:31.450
<b>Even though he cheated on you?</b>

15:32.280 --> 15:33.280
<b>Well...</b>

15:33.820 --> 15:35.490
<b>now that it's in the past...</b>

15:36.040 --> 15:40.870
<b>sometimes I'm glad that he was upfront
about dumping me instead of lying.</b>

15:41.870 --> 15:43.960
<b><i>Sorry, Akane.</i></b>

15:43.960 --> 15:47.050
<b>Because I ended up
not having to feel truly humiliated.</b>

15:48.340 --> 15:49.170
<b><i>Sorry.</i></b>

15:49.920 --> 15:50.760
<b><i>Sorry.</i></b>

15:51.180 --> 15:53.590
<b>I knew that nothing I said
would change his mind,</b>

15:53.590 --> 15:56.600
<b>so I just accepted the breakup right away.</b>

15:58.430 --> 15:59.430
<b><i>Fine.</i></b>

16:00.350 --> 16:01.350
<b>Someday...</b>

16:01.350 --> 16:04.560
<b>when I've become a memory
he looks back on,</b>

16:04.560 --> 16:08.860
<b>I'd rather he remembered me smiling,
instead of crying and wailing.</b>

16:09.990 --> 16:11.820
<b>I want him to think...</b>

16:12.320 --> 16:14.990
<b>"She was a great girl.
I shouldn't have let her go."</b>

16:17.450 --> 16:19.200
<b>Don't you think that's better?</b>

16:25.330 --> 16:26.790
<b><i>Did you...</i></b>

16:28.090 --> 16:29.420
<b><i>feel sorry for me?</i></b>

16:31.720 --> 16:34.090
<b><i>Goodbye, Akito.</i></b>

16:41.640 --> 16:43.230
<b><i>I'm sorry!</i></b>

16:43.230 --> 16:46.310
<b><i>Thank you for always being there for me!</i></b>

16:49.780 --> 16:50.780
<b><i>Goodbye!</i></b>

17:09.090 --> 17:10.380
<b>I guess so.</b>

17:20.220 --> 17:21.720
<b>Rurihime
Yamada
Akane
LovesMeat
Matcha pudding
RuriSabu</b>

17:26.480 --> 17:27.440
<b>Did it go down?</b>

17:28.360 --> 17:30.110
<b>I think it did.</b>

17:29.860 --> 17:32.110
<b>THOUGH I DON'T KNOW
WHEN IT PEAKED</b>

17:30.940 --> 17:34.320
<b>Can I eat that yogurt
you bought?</b>

17:34.320 --> 17:35.240
<b>Go ahead.</b>

17:38.740 --> 17:45.620
<b>MUNCH MUNCH
SNIFF SNIFF...</b>

17:38.740 --> 17:45.620
<b>MUNCH
SNIFF SNIFF
SOB</b>

17:40.830 --> 17:42.700
<b>It's so good,
it brings tears to your eyes?</b>

17:42.700 --> 17:44.790
<b>It kills to swallow.</b>

17:44.790 --> 17:45.620
<b>Oh.</b>

17:47.830 --> 17:51.460
<b><i>If it was anyone other than Yamada
sitting there...</i></b>

17:52.090 --> 17:53.840
<b><i>I would have panicked for sure.</i></b>

17:53.010 --> 17:54.380
<b>SLEEPY</b>

17:54.380 --> 18:00.720
<b>I CAN SEE HIS ANGEL WINGS...</b>

17:54.920 --> 17:59.600
<b><i>What is this vibe he's giving off
that makes me feel safe and secure?</i></b>

18:01.930 --> 18:05.060
<b><i>Well, it must have been an ordeal for him.</i></b>

18:05.560 --> 18:07.690
<b><i>He's uncomfortable around women as it is.</i></b>

18:09.190 --> 18:10.310
<b>Thanks for the yogurt!</b>

18:10.440 --> 18:12.860
<b>Could you put this over there, please?</b>

18:12.860 --> 18:13.730
<b>Sure.</b>

18:15.570 --> 18:16.400
<b>Oh...</b>

18:17.610 --> 18:18.610
<b>crap.</b>

18:18.610 --> 18:19.490
<b>Huh?</b>

18:19.490 --> 18:20.410
<b>Oh.</b>

18:20.410 --> 18:21.240
<b>Oh?</b>

18:21.580 --> 18:23.620
<b>- M-My leg!
- Huh?</b>

18:23.620 --> 18:25.410
<b>I'm getting a cramp.</b>

18:25.410 --> 18:27.370
<b>Cramp! Ouch! Ouch!</b>

18:27.370 --> 18:28.290
<b>Stretch your leg out.</b>

18:28.290 --> 18:30.170
<b>Ow!</b>

18:31.090 --> 18:32.250
<b>You've got to stretch it.</b>

18:33.750 --> 18:35.260
<b>FAINTING IN AGONY</b>

18:36.630 --> 18:37.760
<b><i>Jeez.</i></b>

18:38.180 --> 18:39.010
<b>Akane...</b>

18:43.260 --> 18:45.390
<b>give me your leg.</b>

18:45.560 --> 18:47.430
<b>Ow!</b>

18:47.430 --> 18:49.350
<b>Can't take it! Ouch!</b>

18:49.350 --> 18:50.400
<b>Ow!</b>

18:50.400 --> 18:52.400
<b>It hurts! Please don't touch me!</b>

18:52.770 --> 18:54.150
<b>Quiet.</b>

18:54.150 --> 18:55.410
<b>No!</b>

18:56.280 --> 18:57.240
<b>- Be strong.
- Ow! Ow!</b>

18:57.030 --> 18:58.860
<b>TWIST</b>

18:57.240 --> 19:01.370
<b>It hurts! It hurts! It hurts! Ouch.</b>

19:07.080 --> 19:08.750
<b>It's going away.</b>

19:09.620 --> 19:10.460
<b>Right?</b>

19:12.790 --> 19:14.590
<b>I thought I was going to die.</b>

19:14.590 --> 19:16.090
<b>You're so dramatic.</b>

19:17.840 --> 19:20.130
<b>I'm telling you, it was killing me.</b>

19:27.060 --> 19:27.890
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

19:28.350 --> 19:33.150
<b><i>Seems like... he's totally looking at me.</i></b>

19:34.570 --> 19:39.150
<b><i>Wait, why do I feel so...</i></b>

19:41.530 --> 19:44.870
<b><i>relaxed and safe with this person?</i></b>

19:46.700 --> 19:47.540
<b>Huh?</b>

19:50.040 --> 19:50.790
<b>I PICKED UP THE SPOON YOU DROPPED</b>

19:50.790 --> 19:51.540
<b>SHE HIT HER HEAD</b>

19:50.790 --> 19:51.540
<b>THROB THROB</b>

19:52.830 --> 19:54.420
<b>What? I didn't move away, all right?</b>

19:56.960 --> 19:58.010
<b>Oh.</b>

19:58.510 --> 20:00.470
<b>What? Why are you laughing?</b>

20:02.340 --> 20:03.470
<b>No reason.</b>

20:04.970 --> 20:06.350
<b>Why are you laughing?</b>

20:06.350 --> 20:08.930
<b>It's not what you think!
It's not, all right?</b>

21:38.940 --> 21:40.980
<b>It's not, all right?</b>

21:43.740 --> 21:45.740
<b>COLD COMPRESS
COLD PACK</b>

21:44.280 --> 21:45.740
<b>Okay, I'm leaving now.</b>

21:46.030 --> 21:47.870
<b>You're going to school after not sleeping?</b>

21:48.280 --> 21:50.080
<b>Yes. I'm used to it.</b>

21:50.580 --> 21:55.040
<b>I really am sorry. If you
start feeling sick, let me know, okay?</b>

21:55.040 --> 22:00.920
<b>HEARD ABOUT IT ALL
AFTER HER HEAD
CLEARED</b>

21:55.750 --> 21:58.460
<b>And thanks for everything you did,
like the hospital.</b>

21:58.290 --> 22:00.920
<b>TAKING ME THERE
PAYING FOR ME</b>

21:59.040 --> 22:00.920
<b>I'll thank you properly
another time.</b>

22:02.250 --> 22:05.420
<b>I didn't really do much,
so please don't worry about it.</b>

22:06.380 --> 22:08.180
<b>They said to wait and see for a day,</b>

22:08.180 --> 22:11.600
<b>then come get looked at again
during the day,</b>

22:11.600 --> 22:13.100
<b>so please be sure to do that.</b>

22:13.600 --> 22:15.770
<b>Sure. Don't worry.</b>

22:15.310 --> 22:16.690
<b>IT WAS THE ENDO CLINIC, RIGHT</b>

22:17.310 --> 22:20.690
<b>Seems like they can't do
those really detailed tests.</b>

22:21.650 --> 22:24.690
<b>Well, since you did get
a lot better after the I.V.,</b>

22:24.690 --> 22:26.200
<b>I guess they just want to be sure.</b>

22:30.160 --> 22:31.580
<b>All right, thanks for having me.</b>

22:33.830 --> 22:36.580
<b>Sorry. I didn't realize
you were standing right there.</b>

22:37.080 --> 22:40.250
<b>Hey, sorry! I got too close.</b>

22:41.130 --> 22:42.380
<b><i>It's like...</i></b>

22:43.130 --> 22:45.590
<b><i>my body's getting drawn
towards him of its own accord.</i></b>

22:51.350 --> 22:52.640
<b>Huh?</b>

22:53.220 --> 22:56.520
<b>Akane, I have to go.</b>

22:57.350 --> 22:59.690
<b>Huh? What?</b>

22:59.900 --> 23:02.610
<b>S-S-Sorry! It's not what you think!
Please go!</b>

23:02.610 --> 23:03.440
<b>Are you all right?</b>

23:03.440 --> 23:04.940
<b>Yes! I'm fine! So please go!</b>

23:03.570 --> 23:04.940
<b>ARE YOU LONELY?</b>

23:04.940 --> 23:06.940
<b>Hey, I know!
When I'm done at the hospital,</b>

23:06.940 --> 23:09.530
<b>should I let you know how it went?
I'm sure it's just a cold—</b>

23:09.530 --> 23:10.530
<b>- Huh?
- Huh?</b>

23:10.530 --> 23:12.490
<b>Oh, sorry,
of course you're not interested!</b>

23:12.490 --> 23:14.410
<b>- Huh?
- I-I-I just thought that I might have</b>

23:14.410 --> 23:16.000
<b>- given my cold to you!
- Oh, right.</b>

23:16.000 --> 23:19.500
<b>I just thought that maybe
you were worried, that's all!</b>

23:21.250 --> 23:23.000
<b>Then... please let me know.</b>

23:23.000 --> 23:23.840
<b>Okay!</b>

23:28.340 --> 23:29.260
<b>Take care.</b>
